  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water.\n• Cook spaghetti in boiling water, over high heat, until ‘al dente’, 10 mins.\n• Reserve some pasta water (1/4 cup for 2P / 1/2 cup for 4P) then drain and return to pan. Drizzle with a little olive oil to prevent sticking.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64efe272398480a2a95ea25f-c78865af.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop or crush garlic.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook mushrooms until browned and softened, 6-8 mins.\n• Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 min. Reduce heat to medium.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64efe272398480a2a95ea25f-c57ad612.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add cooking cream and reserved pasta water to mushrooms and cook until bubbling, 1-2 mins.\n• Remove from heat. Add baby spinach, cooked spaghetti and pesto-flavoured powder, tossing to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64efe272398480a2a95ea25f-1c7bc1f4.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide pasta between bowls.\n• Sprinkle with crumbled fetta cubes to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64efe272398480a2a95ea25f-b38e76c8.jpeg"
    }
  ]
